WEBVTT

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:06.859
Open Reports, General, Phone Number Verifications.

00:00:06.859 --> 00:00:13.300
Verification status counts the contacts, and the verified, unverified and invalid numbers, the

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.683
failures, and the success rate.

00:00:16.297 --> 00:00:21.031
Line and queue status shows how many numbers are mobile, landline or VoIP,

00:00:21.031 --> 00:00:24.937
how many are pending, and how many need to be checked again.

00:00:25.517 --> 00:00:30.821
Provider usage shows how many records each provider checked, which is useful when

00:00:30.821 --> 00:00:33.321
you compare what the services cost.

00:00:33.321 --> 00:00:36.917
The Export CSV button downloads the report as a file.

